            "notes": "[The Whambulance](item_67e91029-d0fc-4c9d-9733-ec7e1cc064a9) is a power that just gets some extra healing in there. It pairs amazing with [Triage Unit](item_fec0554c-2685-4b93-822d-bf0020e654b4) and also [Angelic Acrobatics](item_baad85fc-3da5-43af-ad9d-f17885f59aa5). Only get [Angelic Acrobatics](item_baad85fc-3da5-43af-ad9d-f17885f59aa5) if you get [The Whambulance](item_67e91029-d0fc-4c9d-9733-ec7e1cc064a9).\n\n[Serenity](item_c6e1c072-ff50-467e-b59f-9506baea10c1) is a great power if you cant stay alive and you need that extra healing boost. If you end up with [Serenity](item_c6e1c072-ff50-467e-b59f-9506baea10c1) get [Eye of the Spider](item_bbaf01d7-340d-4199-b738-86a98d68fe9b) or [Blessed Boosters](item_957fd380-b7b4-40d4-8333-bb8c535ca931)",
